TASHKENTSPIRE2-TORPEDO.description:
At the end of the turn, deals damage to the enemy with the most [gold]Mark[/gold]. Damage is increased by the target's Mark.
Hit timing depends on your [gold]Distance[/gold] when [gold]launched[/gold]:
[gold]Distance[/gold] [blue]4 or higher[/blue]: End of this turn;
[gold]Distance[/gold] [blue]2–3[/blue]: End of your next turn;
Otherwise: End of your second subsequent turn.
